@startuml
!include ../styl.iuml
[*] --> LOADED : module_load OK
LOADED --> LOADED : module_get_addr (plik otwarty, refs++) / module_put
LOADED --> BUSY : rmmod przy refs > 0
BUSY --> LOADED : -EBUSY zwrócone
LOADED --> GOING : rmmod przy refs == 0 (going = true)
GOING --> [*] : exit(), driver_unregister_owner, destruktory, drop_deps, kfree
@enduml
